      <activity id="653559ac-5e1d-5c64-ae51-6f512e503b02" activityNameId="2ff5229a-2b6f-5e76-9307-001ce121750b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hard coal, at power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hard coal, at power plant
The average allocated net electrical efficiency is about 37.9 %. The electricity generation of this technology in the region is at about 200 TWh based on Eurostat/IEA. NA; UUID: 52d3c8c4-69ce-35f4-84dc-2b987a362267
Electricity output at busbar. The dataset is composed of the electricity generation in covered sub-regions and thus uses the average net efficiencies of power plants in those regions adjusted for co-generation (using allocation based on exergy content). 
Location: ENTSO-E in 2019
Technology: Average installed technology.
Time period: 
Production volume: 200 TWh
Sampling: Databases/ literature data based on regional statistics.
Extrapolations: No relevant extrapolations.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_52d3c8c4-69ce-35f4-84dc-2b987a362267.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
